Package: yara-downloader
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: CLI tool to download YARA Forge rules
 yara-downloader is a command-line tool that downloads the latest
 YARA Forge rules from GitHub, creates date-tagged folders,
 extracts only .yar files, and manages updates by checking existing
 downloads. It supports INI-based configuration with conf.d override
 support.
